{"product_id":"kingfisher-readers-l5-the-changing-environment","title":"Kingfisher Readers L5: The Changing Environment","description":"\u003cp\u003eLEVEL 5 – READING FLUENTLYFor readers fast developing in confidence and ability. At this level there is a more sophisticated range of sentences, vocabulary and language features. Includes glossary and index.Guided Reading Levels: P,QKingfisher Readers L5: The Changing Environment by Philip Steele is a fact-filled introduction to the Earth and its systems and provides fluent readers with an overview of how the Earth and its inhabitants are all interconnected. With chapters devoted to environmental dangers caused by weather and people, animal extinction, and how we can make a positive difference, this book will help children understand the importance of their environment and conservation. With diagrams, call-out boxes, a deep glossary, and an extensive index to aid them, budding environmentalists will also build their scientific knowledge and research skills.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 148 x 227\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Deborah Chancellor\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780753471531\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472787759257,"sku":"7RC9780753471531","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff84fa44ba-Kingfisher-Readers-L5-The-Changing-Environment-Deborah-Chancellor-_1.jpg?v=1753121451","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/kingfisher-readers-l5-the-changing-environment","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}